            "review_text": "Elena F\n37 contributions\n0\nFood is ok . Stuff is welcome .Manager is rude . Union pay card is not accepted and you get this info in the end .\nJul 2026 • Solo\n4 years ago it was very nice place . This time I faced huge humiliation from manager and owner . I had limited cash and Union pay card . This card daily I use in Da nang even in small shops . As always I asked if they accepted card - yes , they said . In short words , they do not accept union pay card. They pushed me to give last cash , no one helped me reach atm . The most terrible thing WAS, manager said that I am cheater and my card is broken )))), even after I showed her plenty bank messages , conforming payment .\nI was loud , it is true , this is my mistake , but ! I was lowed only after I was represented as a cheater .\nThe his is fully mistake of restaurant - the type of payment should be confirmed before . Instead , manager told me that I HAVE TO SHOW card ti the stuff before order . \nAbout food : normal , nothing special .\nService : full shock , as Vietnamese people are very kind and welcome . \nIn the end , manager told me that I humiliated her stuff- it is absolutely lie .\nThen she showed me a sight Visa in the door , but the machine they have accept 4 types of card .\nNo sorry , nothing ! \nNo understanding that you are wrong - all what they need is a bill wich is payed . They do not want to develop , they do not want to listen .\nPhone talk with owner was so loud , just repeating “pay or we will call to police “.\nVietnam has plenty of nice places to eat , just choose them\nRead more\nWritten July 30, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
